<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-25843] Remove from core/pom.xml resources to provided deps</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-25843</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Currently ignite-core/pom.xml contains custom resources directory that links to provided deps target directories.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This configuration is wrong and misleads Intellij IDEA about sources directories. That sometimes lead to failing code generation in &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-25490&quot; title=&quot;Generate MessageSerializer for Message#readFrom, Message#writeTo methods&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-25490&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-25490&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The configuration looks like a hot fix that makes ClassGenerator works (that prepares&#160;&lt;br/&gt;
classnames.properties file)&lt;/p&gt;</description>
